Mall Customer Preprocessing Dataset
Rows: 2200, Columns: 25

Purpose: Practical coding assignment for Data Preprocessing up to Week 7.

Included problems/opportunities:
- Missing values in Age, AnnualIncome_INR, LastPurchaseDate, AvgBasketValue_INR, TotalPurchases, Gender, EmailProvider, DeviceType, ChurnNextMonth.
- Duplicate rows and duplicate CustomerID with conflicting values.
- Inconsistent categorical values: Gender, MembershipTier, City, Country, PreferredCategory, DeviceType, PaymentMethod, CouponUsed.
- Extra spaces and mixed case in CustomerName, City, Country, MembershipTier, PaymentMethod.
- Invalid values: negative age, age > 120, invalid dates, negative basket value, negative purchases, satisfaction > 5, negative loyalty points.
- Outliers: very high income, high basket value, high total purchases, high loyalty points.
- Transformation opportunities: scaling AnnualIncome_INR, AvgBasketValue_INR, LoyaltyPoints, purchase counts; encoding categorical variables; date parsing.
- Reduction opportunities: attribute subset selection, correlation filtering, PCA after encoding/scaling, sampling.
- Proximity opportunities: customer similarity using numeric features and/or mixed categorical features.

Suggested target column: ChurnNextMonth.
Dataset:
https://github.com/swapnilsaurav/Dataset/blob/master/mall_customer_preprocessing_dataset.csv
